{
  "id": "u59",
  "section": 8,
  "order": 3,
  "title": "Explaining things",
  "teTitle": "విడమరచి చెప్పడం",
  "cefr": "B1+",
  "register": "standard",
  "description": "Explain anything step by step — unpack it with అంటే ఏంటంటే, reach for an analogy, and check understanding as you go.",
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "u59-i01",
      "te": "ముందుగా ఈ యాప్ తెరవండి.",
      "gloss": "First, open this app.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "ముందుగా", "gloss": "first / to begin with" },
        { "te": "ఈ", "gloss": "this" },
        { "te": "యాప్", "gloss": "app" },
        { "te": "తెరవండి", "gloss": "open (polite)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["explaining", "steps", "commands"],
      "difficulty": 3,
      "note": "ముందుగా announces step one. Chain steps with ఆ తర్వాత (then) and ఆఖరున (finally) — listeners follow numbered steps far better than a blur of instructions."
    },
    {
      "id": "u59-i02",
      "te": "ఆ తర్వాత మీ నంబర్ నొక్కండి.",
      "gloss": "After that, type in your number.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "ఆ", "gloss": "that" },
        { "te": "తర్వాత", "gloss": "after" },
        { "te": "మీ", "gloss": "your (polite)" },
        { "te": "నంబర్", "gloss": "number" },
        { "te": "నొక్కండి", "gloss": "press (polite)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["explaining", "steps", "commands"],
      "difficulty": 3,
      "distractors": ["u59-i01", "u59-i11"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u59-i03",
      "te": "అంటే ఏంటంటే, ఇది డబ్బు పంపే మార్గం.",
      "gloss": "What it means is, this is a way to send money.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "అంటే", "gloss": "that is" },
        { "te": "ఏంటంటే", "gloss": "what it is, is" },
        { "te": "ఇది", "gloss": "this" },
        { "te": "డబ్బు", "gloss": "money" },
        { "te": "పంపే", "gloss": "sending (that sends)" },
        { "te": "మార్గం", "gloss": "way / method" }
      ],
      "tags": ["explaining", "meaning"],
      "difficulty": 4,
      "note": "అంటే ఏంటంటే... is the everyday unpacking phrase — 'what that means is...'. Drop it in whenever a word or idea needs opening up."
    },
    {
      "id": "u59-i04",
      "te": "ఇక్కడ వరకు అర్థమైందా?",
      "gloss": "Is it clear up to here?",
      "words": [
        { "te": "ఇక్కడ", "gloss": "here" },
        { "te": "వరకు", "gloss": "up to" },
        { "te": "అర్థమైందా", "gloss": "did (it) make sense?" }
      ],
      "tags": ["explaining", "checking", "questions"],
      "difficulty": 3,
      "note": "Good explainers pause and check in chunks — ఇక్కడ వరకు అర్థమైందా? after every couple of steps, not one big 'got it?' at the end."
    },
    {
      "id": "u59-i05",
      "te": "అర్థం కాలేదు, ఇంకోసారి చెప్పండి.",
      "gloss": "I didn't understand — please say it once more.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "అర్థం", "gloss": "meaning / understanding" },
        { "te": "కాలేదు", "gloss": "didn't happen" },
        { "te": "ఇంకోసారి", "gloss": "one more time" },
        { "te": "చెప్పండి", "gloss": "tell (polite)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["explaining", "checking"],
      "difficulty": 3,
      "distractors": ["u59-i04", "u59-i13"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u59-i06",
      "te": "నెమ్మదిగా చెప్తాను, కంగారు పడకండి.",
      "gloss": "I'll explain slowly — don't panic.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "నెమ్మదిగా", "gloss": "slowly" },
        { "te": "చెప్తాను", "gloss": "I will tell" },
        { "te": "కంగారు", "gloss": "panic / fluster" },
        { "te": "పడకండి", "gloss": "don't fall into (polite)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["explaining", "reassurance"],
      "difficulty": 3,
      "distractors": ["u59-i05"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u59-i07",
      "te": "ఇది దాదాపు లెటర్ పంపడం లాంటిదే.",
      "gloss": "This is almost like sending a letter.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "ఇది", "gloss": "this" },
        { "te": "దాదాపు", "gloss": "almost / nearly" },
        { "te": "లెటర్", "gloss": "letter" },
        { "te": "పంపడం", "gloss": "sending" },
        { "te": "లాంటిదే", "gloss": "is just like" }
      ],
      "tags": ["explaining", "analogy"],
      "difficulty": 4,
      "note": "లాంటిది means 'something like'. Analogies are the fastest bridge — attach the new thing to something the listener already knows, and the -ఏ ending (లాంటిదే) adds 'it really IS like that'."
    },
    {
      "id": "u59-i08",
      "te": "ఉదాహరణకి, నాకు వంద రూపాయలు పంపండి.",
      "gloss": "For example, send me a hundred rupees.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "ఉదాహరణకి", "gloss": "for example" },
        { "te": "నాకు", "gloss": "to me" },
        { "te": "వంద", "gloss": "hundred" },
        { "te": "రూపాయలు", "gloss": "rupees" },
        { "te": "పంపండి", "gloss": "send (polite)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["explaining", "examples"],
      "difficulty": 3,
      "distractors": ["u59-i07", "u59-i02"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u59-i09",
      "te": "మీరు చేయండి, నేను పక్కనే ఉంటాను.",
      "gloss": "You do it — I'll be right beside you.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "మీరు", "gloss": "you (polite)" },
        { "te": "చేయండి", "gloss": "do (polite)" },
        { "te": "నేను", "gloss": "I" },
        { "te": "పక్కనే", "gloss": "right beside" },
        { "te": "ఉంటాను", "gloss": "will be" }
      ],
      "tags": ["explaining", "reassurance"],
      "difficulty": 3,
      "distractors": ["u59-i12"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u59-i10",
      "te": "ఒక్క స్టెప్ కూడా వదలకుండా చెప్పండి.",
      "gloss": "Explain it without skipping a single step.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "ఒక్క", "gloss": "a single" },
        { "te": "స్టెప్", "gloss": "step" },
        { "te": "కూడా", "gloss": "even" },
        { "te": "వదలకుండా", "gloss": "without leaving out" },
        { "te": "చెప్పండి", "gloss": "tell (polite)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["explaining", "requests"],
      "difficulty": 4
    },
    {
      "id": "u59-i11",
      "te": "ఆఖరున ఈ పచ్చ బటన్ నొక్కాలి.",
      "gloss": "At the end, you have to press this green button.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "ఆఖరున", "gloss": "at the end / finally" },
        { "te": "ఈ", "gloss": "this" },
        { "te": "పచ్చ", "gloss": "green" },
        { "te": "బటన్", "gloss": "button" },
        { "te": "నొక్కాలి", "gloss": "must press" }
      ],
      "tags": ["explaining", "steps"],
      "difficulty": 3,
      "distractors": ["u59-i02", "u59-i01"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u59-i12",
      "te": "ఇప్పుడు మీకే అర్థమవుతుంది, చూడండి.",
      "gloss": "Now you'll understand it yourself — watch.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "ఇప్పుడు", "gloss": "now" },
        { "te": "మీకే", "gloss": "to you yourself" },
        { "te": "అర్థమవుతుంది", "gloss": "will become clear" },
        { "te": "చూడండి", "gloss": "see (polite)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["explaining", "reassurance"],
      "difficulty": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "u59-i13",
      "te": "అమ్మో, ఇది చాలా సులభమే!",
      "gloss": "Oh my — this is really easy!",
      "words": [
        { "te": "అమ్మో", "gloss": "oh my! (surprise)" },
        { "te": "ఇది", "gloss": "this" },
        { "te": "చాలా", "gloss": "very" },
        { "te": "సులభమే", "gloss": "is indeed easy" }
      ],
      "tags": ["explaining", "reactions"],
      "difficulty": 3,
      "distractors": ["u59-i12"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u59-i14",
      "te": "మర్చిపోతే మళ్ళీ నన్ను అడగండి.",
      "gloss": "If you forget, ask me again.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "మర్చిపోతే", "gloss": "if (you) forget" },
        { "te": "మళ్ళీ", "gloss": "again" },
        { "te": "నన్ను", "gloss": "me" },
        { "te": "అడగండి", "gloss": "ask (polite)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["explaining", "reassurance"],
      "difficulty": 3,
      "distractors": ["u59-i05"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u59-i15",
      "te": "క్లుప్తంగా చెప్పాలంటే, ఫోనే మీ బ్యాంకు.",
      "gloss": "To put it briefly, your phone IS your bank.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "క్లుప్తంగా", "gloss": "briefly / in short" },
        { "te": "చెప్పాలంటే", "gloss": "if one must say" },
        { "te": "ఫోనే", "gloss": "the phone itself" },
        { "te": "మీ", "gloss": "your (polite)" },
        { "te": "బ్యాంకు", "gloss": "bank" }
      ],
      "tags": ["explaining", "meaning"],
      "difficulty": 4,
      "note": "క్లుప్తంగా చెప్పాలంటే = 'to put it in short'. End every explanation with a one-line summary — it is what people remember."
    },
    {
      "id": "u59-i16",
      "te": "మీకు అర్థమైనట్టు నాకు చెప్పండి.",
      "gloss": "Tell it back to me the way you understood it.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "మీకు", "gloss": "to you (polite)" },
        { "te": "అర్థమైనట్టు", "gloss": "as (it) was understood" },
        { "te": "నాకు", "gloss": "to me" },
        { "te": "చెప్పండి", "gloss": "tell (polite)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["explaining", "checking"],
      "difficulty": 4
    }
  ],
